# Puppet Crafting's "or non-Aura enchantment": Bot1's Fastbond (a plain enchantment) is a legal host and becomes a 5/5 Construct
# creature that is still an enchantment ("in addition to its other types"). Mox Emerald pays for Fastbond; a second Emerald and Mox
# Jet pay {1}{G} for the Puppet Crafting.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald x2
Mox Jet
Fastbond
Puppet Crafting
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#1.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Fastbond.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Puppet Crafting.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Fastbond)
Bot2.Pass
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Fastbond.Types = Enchantment; Creature
Bot1.Battlefield.Fastbond.Subtypes = Construct
Bot1.Battlefield.Fastbond.Power = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Fastbond.Toughness = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Puppet Crafting.AttachedTo = Fastbond
